## 2. Solution Overview

</aside>

DhanSathi is a React Native Android app with three core tabs (Insurance, Investment, Borrowing), an AI voice agent (Vaani), and an Account Aggregator-backed financial tracker. The architecture is outlined in Section A5 of the Phase 2 submission. The PRD covers all MVP-scope features from Must Have and selected Should Have tiers.

**Product principles:**
- Hindi-first, one-action-per-screen, no English jargon without explanation
- Liquid options first in every financial recommendation — no lock-in without explicit user intent
- Source transparency — every scheme recommendation links to the official government portal
- Anti-scam declaration visible before any data request
- No lock-in for DhanSathi itself — cancel anytime, no penalty

