### US-02 — Risk Profile Assessment

**Story:** As a user, I want to complete a 2-minute risk profile so that investment, insurance, and borrowing suggestions are matched to how much risk my income situation can actually absorb.

**Story Points:** 3 · **Priority:** P0 (Must Have)

**Functional Requirements:**

| ID | Requirement |
| --- | --- |
| FR-02-01 | System should present exactly 5 questions, each with 2–3 answer options, completing in under 2 minutes |
