### US-04 — T&C Transparency Layer

**Story:** As a user, I want every scheme’s terms and conditions shown clearly upfront, so that I know exactly what I’m agreeing to before I commit.

**Story Points:** 3 · **Priority:** P0 (Must Have)

**Functional Requirements:**

| ID | Requirement |
| --- | --- |
| FR-04-01 | Every scheme detail screen must display before any enrollment action: what the user pays (exact amount and frequency), what the user gets (coverage amount and scope), exit conditions (how to cancel or withdraw), penalty for early exit (if any) |
