**M2.2 — Scheme Detail and T&C Module**
Scheme detail screen with four structured sections: What you pay, What you get, Exit conditions, Official verification link. Hindi-first rendering with English toggle. Scroll-gate on enrollment CTA. User flow: Scheme card tapped → Detail screen opens → T&C sections displayed → User scrolls or confirms → Enroll CTA activates.

