**M5.2 — Cost Comparison Module**
Takes borrowing amount and term from Vaani session. Calculates: informal moneylender interest (5% per month assumed, clearly labeled as “typical informal rate”) vs. PM Mudra rate (10.5% per year, government source). Renders as side-by-side comparison card with total interest numbers prominent. User flow: Amount and term received → Comparison card rendered → [Apply for PM Mudra] → In-app browser to Jan Samarth portal.

