**M5.3 — PM Mudra Eligibility Module**
Basic eligibility check against PM Mudra Shishu criteria (business registration, loan amount up to Rs. 50,000). If user qualifies, a “You likely qualify” badge appears. If document pre-fill is available (EPIC 7), application fields are pre-populated in the in-app browser session. Connects to Jan Samarth portal or PM Mudra partner bank API.

