<aside>

## 12. Global Edge Cases and Failure Scenarios

</aside>

| Scenario | System behavior |
| --- | --- |
| AA consent given but API returns no transaction data | Fall back to manual income input; mark AA as pending re-fetch; do not fail onboarding |
| Scheme eligibility engine returns empty list for user profile | Display “No schemes found for your current profile” with a prompt to update income type |
| Vaani session times out mid-conversation | Session state preserved for 10 minutes; “Resume session?” prompt on app reopen |
| Enrollment API fails (scheme portal timeout) | Error screen: “Enrollment is processing — check back in 24 hours”; data preserved; user notified via push when processed |
| OCR extraction confidence below 80% | Flag field to user for manual confirmation; do not auto-submit low-confidence extractions |
| Aadhaar eKYC OTP fails three times | Lock eKYC for 30 minutes; offer manual document upload as alternative |
| User opens the app with no internet | Show cached dashboard with a “Last updated [timestamp]” banner; Vaani and enrollment flows disabled with a clear offline message |
| Investment product data unavailable (AMFI API down) | Show cached product list with “Prices as of [last_updated]” label; disable investment action until live data is available |
| User attempts to enroll in a scheme they are already enrolled in | System detects existing enrollment from profile; shows “Already enrolled” status with certificate download option |

